      "message": "Yes, I think David has a point.\nI haven\u0027t seen this happen during shutdown, but we install `WorkQueueModule` before `GerritGlobalModule`, so shutdown will stop our provider *before* `WorkQueue` finishes draining tasks.\n\nAlso, `ChangeExternalIdCaseSensitivityIT` tests are failing:\n\n```\n\nRequested by:\n1  : ExternalIdReader.\u003cinit\u003e(ExternalIdReader.java:93)\n      \\_ for 1st parameter allUsersRepositoryProvider\n     at ExternalIdsNoteDbImpl.\u003cinit\u003e(ExternalIdsNoteDbImpl.java:54)\n      \\_ for 1st parameter externalIdReader\n     at ExternalIdNoteDbReadStorageModule.configure(ExternalIdNoteDbReadStorageModule.java:27)\n      \\_ installed by: ChangeExternalIdCaseSensitivity$1 -\u003e ExternalIdNoteDbReadStorageModule\n```\n\nThis is because `ExternalIdNoteDbReadStorageModule` doesn’t install `GitModule`, which currently installs the `@allUsersRepository` provider.\n\nMoving the provider binding into `SchemaModule` will address both concerns.\n\nWDYT @david.ostrovsky@gmail.com, @luca.milanesio@gmail.com?",
